{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_FA71534B","title":"Flesh","entry":"Dlg_FA71534B::entry","exit":"Dlg_FA71534B::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_7CE633E3","articyId":"72057778721524746","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Hello friendly mariner! You're not in the belly of any sea-born beast, so I sense the waters are treating you well?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hello friendly mariner! You're not in the belly of any sea-born beast, so I sense the waters are treating you well?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":-1000.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18531","byteOffset":14896240,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_E5DBFE51","articyId":"72057778721524767","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Selling this. Buying that. Do you know what Foamheart just fished out of those waters?","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Selling this. Buying that. Do you know what Foamheart just fished out of those waters?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":-400.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21613","byteOffset":16066496,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_922A5414","articyId":"72057778721524788","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"And let it rust at the bottom of the sea? I thought you were a true mariner!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And let it rust at the bottom of the sea? I thought you were a true mariner!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51376","byteOffset":33851352,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_C1B8F5E0","articyId":"72057778721524796","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Foolish landlubbers.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Foolish landlubbers.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":800.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36576","byteOffset":28182144,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_A1E2C59A","articyId":"72057778721524812","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Ah... A ship done run a reef? What's got them on the ropes? Must be good if it's got you worried too!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah... A ship done run a reef? What's got them on the ropes? Must be good if it's got you worried too!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1400.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49622","byteOffset":33115328,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_36E439E8","articyId":"72057778721524827","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Whoa, whoa, whoa! That pin right there is an ill omen for anyone who rubs their fingers upon it.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Whoa, whoa, whoa! That pin right there is an ill omen for anyone who rubs their fingers upon it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2000.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17351","byteOffset":14452872,"byteLength":484}},{"id":"DFr_12AEEA43","articyId":"72057778721524849","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Aye, then they should consider themselves lucky. If they had gone poof while holding it, the lady of the luscious sea would be feasting on their bones!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Aye, then they should consider themselves lucky. If they had gone poof while holding it, the lady of the luscious sea would be feasting on their bones!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3200.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48152","byteOffset":32552824,"byteLength":504}},{"id":"DFr_70D3DAE6","articyId":"72057778721524863","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Suppose that's true. If they did, the shipping Corpsters would probably break 'em and toss that pin into the sea.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Suppose that's true. If they did, the shipping Corpsters would probably break 'em and toss that pin into the sea.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3800.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50832","byteOffset":33570904,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_94AC9A3C","articyId":"72057778721524884","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"If the wearer of that pin were taking part in an unsanctioned collective of workers, then sure as the tides, something bad did happen to them!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"If the wearer of that pin were taking part in an unsanctioned collective of workers, then sure as the tides, something bad did happen to them!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":4400.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24945","byteOffset":17317792,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_75666237","articyId":"72057778721524899","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Let me think for a moment... If it's a matter of unsanctioned organization, I'd set sail for the Oil Rig and talk with Delbert.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Let me think for a moment... If it's a matter of unsanctioned organization, I'd set sail for the Oil Rig and talk with Delbert.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5000.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24276","byteOffset":17060872,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_9455667A","articyId":"72057606922844220","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"His Separatist movement has been growing and I'd wager a day of calm seas that he's received some kind of message or something from other groups.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"His Separatist movement has been growing and I'd wager a day of calm seas that he's received some kind of message or something from other groups.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5300.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32375","byteOffset":20130192,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_74E9F86B","articyId":"72057606922844227","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Or at least I'd hope so. Can't become a collective without being... collected. Good luck!","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Or at least I'd hope so. Can't become a collective without being... collected. Good luck!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":5600.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"48615","byteOffset":32727792,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_D38378FA","articyId":"72057821671306556","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"A HOVA-A1 Hydrogen Converter. An actual A1! And I can't get a landlocked pair of legs to give me a decent price for it.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A HOVA-A1 Hydrogen Converter. An actual A1! And I can't get a landlocked pair of legs to give me a decent price for it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":200.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28702","byteOffset":18741600,"byteLength":464}},{"id":"DFr_3FC18E39","articyId":"72057821671306582","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Bring that aboard your vessel and you'll feel the pressure of the depths closing in.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Bring that aboard your vessel and you'll feel the pressure of the depths closing in.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2600.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35289","byteOffset":25710976,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_8401DEFD","articyId":"72057821671306614","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salt Pete","text":"Depends on where you found it.","speakerId":"Ntt_87542622","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Depends on where you found it.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"sc